    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tung Tung Tung Sahur",
    "steam_appid": 2907810,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907810/extras/d156067284d291d7c130d0d4c76e4e59.avif?t=1748811257\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</strong> is a hide-and-seek-style horror game where your goal is to solve puzzles scattered throughout a secluded mansion while escaping a bizarre and relentless creature: Tung Tung Tung Sahur himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from a lab experiment by an eccentric scientist, Sahur lost his creator and now fiercely defends the place he calls home. If he catches you three times... it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple puzzles that can be solved in any order, giving players the freedom to craft different escape strategies and uncover hidden paths. With each attempt, the mansion reveals more secrets\u2014including a mysterious underground lab and the appearance of Tralalero Tralala, a boss encounter that pushes your survival to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the chaotic and surreal world of Italian Brainrot memes, this game blends horror, puzzles, and absurd visuals into a tense and unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive long enough to call for help?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907810/extras/245d30e36d45d279d1e778c61d51fb2d.avif?t=1748811257\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from <strong>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</strong>: a bizarre and unpredictable creature, born from the remains of an extinct ancestor by a lonely scientist. He was loved\u2026 until he was alone. Now he\u2019ll protect his home at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tralalero Tralala</strong> is here too \u2013 and he's not playing around. Face a surprise boss fight in the lab in one of the game\u2019s most intense moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907810/extras/a69ccbf01111474a5193792ef5eded7e.avif?t=1748811257\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, keys, secrets, and game over!: Get caught three times and wake up in a new nightmare. But keep trying. Solve the puzzles and call the police to end Sahur\u2019s reign of terror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907810/extras/ff078177ca8c529050098509dfac5fc4.avif?t=1748811257\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907810/extras/d156067284d291d7c130d0d4c76e4e59.avif?t=1748811257\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</strong> is a hide-and-seek-style horror game where your goal is to solve puzzles scattered throughout a secluded mansion while escaping a bizarre and relentless creature: Tung Tung Tung Sahur himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born from a lab experiment by an eccentric scientist, Sahur lost his creator and now fiercely defends the place he calls home. If he catches you three times... it\u2019s game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple puzzles that can be solved in any order, giving players the freedom to craft different escape strategies and uncover hidden paths. With each attempt, the mansion reveals more secrets\u2014including a mysterious underground lab and the appearance of Tralalero Tralala, a boss encounter that pushes your survival to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the chaotic and surreal world of Italian Brainrot memes, this game blends horror, puzzles, and absurd visuals into a tense and unforgettable experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive long enough to call for help?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907810/extras/245d30e36d45d279d1e778c61d51fb2d.avif?t=1748811257\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from <strong>Tung Tung Tung Sahur</strong>: a bizarre and unpredictable creature, born from the remains of an extinct ancestor by a lonely scientist. He was loved\u2026 until he was alone. Now he\u2019ll protect his home at all costs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tralalero Tralala</strong> is here too \u2013 and he's not playing around. Face a surprise boss fight in the lab in one of the game\u2019s most intense moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907810/extras/a69ccbf01111474a5193792ef5eded7e.avif?t=1748811257\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles, keys, secrets, and game over!: Get caught three times and wake up in a new nightmare. But keep trying. Solve the puzzles and call the police to end Sahur\u2019s reign of terror!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907810/extras/ff078177ca8c529050098509dfac5fc4.avif?t=1748811257\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Tung Tung Tung Sahur is hunting you! Inside a lonely, haunted mansion. Solve puzzles, hide, and survive the terror of this bizarre creature inspired by the Italian Brainrot universe. Discover dark secrets, face deadly traps, and escape before it's too late.",
